        {
          "type": "doc_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.105,
            0.816,
            0.2
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "content": "WE DISTRIUTE, YET 6 THINGS MULTIPLY"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.225,
            0.288,
            0.245
          ],
          "content": "**Page No. 138**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.26,
            0.848,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": "？ Will the product always increase? Find 3 examples where the product decreases."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.311,
            0.575,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** The product will not always increase."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.338,
            0.447,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": "For $a=10,   b=3;   ab=30$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.358,
            0.565,
            0.377
          ],
          "content": "a-1=9, \\\\ b-1=2; \\quad (a-1)(b-1)=18",
          "image_source": "images/page_23_equation_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.378,
            0.434,
            0.398
          ],
          "content": "Thus, (a – 1) (b – 1) < ab"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.398,
            0.437,
            0.418
          ],
          "content": "Try for more examples."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.428,
            0.288,
            0.448
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No. 140"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.453,
            0.668,
            0.478
          ],
          "content": "Use Identity 1 to find how the product changes when"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.479,
            0.826,
            0.5
          ],
          "content": "(i) one number is decreased by 2 and the other increased by 3;"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.503,
            0.807,
            0.545
          ],
          "content": "(ii) both numbers are decreased, one by 3 and the other by 4. **Ans.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.552,
            0.544,
            0.572
          ],
          "content": "(i) $(a - 2)(b + 3) = ab + 3a - 2b - 6$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.576,
            0.551,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $(a - 3)(b - 4) = ab - 4a - 3b + 12$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.606,
            0.287,
            0.627
          ],
          "content": "**Page No. 142**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.64,
            0.294,
            0.664
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.672,
            0.848,
            0.749
          ],
          "content": "1. Observe the multiplication grid below. Each number inside the grid is formed by multiplying two numbers. If the middle number of a 3 × 3 frame is given by the expression pq, as shown in the figure, write the expressions for the other numbers in the grid."
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.879,
